            <p><strong>Impact:</strong> Field administrative workers manage local land records and rural development schemes, benefiting from substantial basic salary expansion.</p>
            <span class="cadre-footer">Patwari (7th CPC): ₹24,700 | 8th CPC (2.28x): <strong>₹56,316</strong></span>
